        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Galois Theory",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "GALOIS GROUP: Gal(K/F) = Aut(K/F) when K/F is Galois."
    },
    {
      "id": "06-GALOIS-THEORY.md#010",
      "path": [
        "06-GALOIS-THEORY.md"
