        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Galois Theory",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "K^H is a subfield of K containing F.\n  [K : K^H] = |H|.  (Artin's theorem — key fact)\n  K/K^H is a Galois extension with Gal(K/K^H) = H.\n```"
